#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/filter-sampling.md:1
#: fcbd0ce2a7be45638088c9b058de3f37
msgid "筛选"
msgstr "Filtering"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/filter-sampling.md:3
#: 8a4dde7e42714cd588f4e33c5a6da007
msgid "这两张卡片处理整批结构，而不是逐个生成新构型："
msgstr ""
"These cards process a batch of structures instead of generating new configurations "
"one by one:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/filter-sampling.md:5
#: 058f479dbdcf4b6e9db95413824b17cc
msgid "先用 `Geometry Filter` 删除违反明确几何阈值的结构。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Geometry Filter` first to remove structures that violate explicit geometric "
"thresholds."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/filter-sampling.md:6
#: e0fe9996eb4048fd92dc8da99a3bef3c
msgid "必要时在 `NEP Dataset Display` 中继续复核异常结构。"
msgstr "If needed, continue reviewing anomalous structures in `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/filter-sampling.md:7
#: d7cab23570eb4cde9087a720e8ff6c4c
msgid "候选池基本干净后，再用 `FPS Filter` 选择代表结构。"
msgstr ""
"Once the candidate pool is reasonably clean, use `FPS Filter` to select "
"representative structures."

#~ msgid "过滤与代表性采样"
#~ msgstr "Filtering and representative sampling"
